{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "6f2974f6-275c-8035-8ea0-e9f259dfb2aa",
  "created_at": "2026-01-11T17:31:59-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Linda Peckham",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T17:29:12-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T17:29:15-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello, yes, hi. Um, I know City Hall is closed, it is Sunday evening, but the recording said to call this number for storm problems. Is okay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T17:29:25-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, you got the right place. This line stays open after the storm. What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T17:29:31-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is the storm drain in front of my house. After the storm from Friday into Saturday, yesterday, the water comes and comes. It [line breaks up] from the next street, down the hill, and goes straight into my yard."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T17:29:45-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, sorry, you broke up a little there. Water's coming down the hill from the next street into your yard. Can I get the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T17:29:54-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, eighty-two Kay Street. In Historic Hill. The drain is right at the corner by my fence, and it is full with leaves."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T17:30:03-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Eighty-two Kay Street, got it. Writing that down. Drain's clogged with leaves, water's heading into the yard. Did you try anything?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T17:30:11-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I go out with my hands and I clean the grate. All the leaves, I take them off. And it was better for maybe ten minutes. Only ten minutes! Then it is blocked again, everything comes down from the hill again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T17:30:26-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that'll happen, the leaves just keep washing down from above. Ten minutes of relief, then back to square one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T17:30:34-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Square one, that means the beginning, yes? Yes. So please, I ask that somebody comes and cleans the drain. Really cleans, with the truck or whatever you use. [inaudible] it is not good to wait."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T17:30:47-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. I'm putting in a request for the drain to be cleaned out at eighty-two Kay. I can't tell you exactly when a crew gets there, they've got a lot of calls after a storm like this."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T17:31:00-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Always they have a lot of calls. This is not the first time the water comes like this. I want somebody to actually come, not only write it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T17:31:10-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fair enough. It's in the system tonight so it'll be in front of the crew first thing tomorrow. Do you want me to put a callback number on it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T17:31:21-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, it is four zero one, five five five, zero one five three. You hear me okay? My phone is [line breaks up] bad here. My cousin borrowed my charger and never brought it back, so I try to save the battery."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T17:31:36-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-five-three. That came through clear. Name on it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T17:31:41-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Linda Peckham. P-E-C-K-H-A-M."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T17:31:43-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect, Linda Peckham, eighty-two Kay, drain cleaning, water into the yard from the street above. If it gets worse overnight, call back on this line."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T17:31:52-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thank you. I hope they come tomorrow, really."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-11T17:31:56-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll flag it. Take care, Linda."
    }
  ],
